# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Discloud config — DASHBOARD application
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hosts the Next.js dashboard on Discloud as TYPE=site.
# Requires Gold+ tier for site hosting. Set DISCLOUD_SITE=true in the app env
# so next.config.js binds port 8080 / 0.0.0.0 (Discloud requirement).
# The dashboard connects to the same Supabase project the bot uses — no DB
# migration needed. Supabase's free tier covers this project.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

ID=pow-bot-dashboard
TYPE=site
MAIN=
RAM=512
VERSION=20
APT=
BUILD=npm run build
START=npm run start
AUTORESTART=true
